    "description": {
      "value": "After you drink this mutagen, your body becomes thick and sturdy. You exhibit a healthy glow, though you tend to be ponderous and unobservant. Benefit You gain an item bonus to Fortitude saves and the listed number of temporary Hit Points. Whenever you are at maximum Hit Points for at least 1 full minute, you regain the temporary Hit Points. Drawback You take a \u20132 penalty to Will saves, Perception checks, and initiative rolls. The bonus is +2, you gain 10 temporary Hit Points, and the duration is 10 minutes."
